  "description": "For each expression [('q'+7) In (1, 2) ;; ('q'+7) Between 1 And 2 ;; 1 In (1/0, 2) ;; 1 Between 1/0 And 2 ;; (1/0) In (1, 2) ;; (1/0) Between 1 And 2 ;; 1 In (1, 'x') ;; 'x' In (1, 2) ;; 1 In ('1', 2) ;; 1 In (1, 2) ;; 3 In (1, 2) ;; Null In (1, 2) ;; 1 In (Null, 2)]: SELECT e FROM One as a snapshot, then the field's Value read; then for each [ID In (1, 'x') ;; K In (1, 2) ;; ID In (1, 2) ;; K In ('a', 'b') ;; (ID/0) In (1, 2) ;; (ID/0) Between 1 And 2 ;; ID Between 'x' And 'y']: SELECT ID, e FROM T9 WHERE ID = 1, every value read. Whether In folds at open like a call, where the failing part sits, and over fields (r-expr-1b/cmp-between-in observation). The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
